  "abstract": "Reproduce a simple, robust baseline: Fourier Forecaster LN with fixed ramp (learn_gamma=False), p=36, H=128, drop=0.05, Adam lr=9e\u22124, global clip=1.0, and curvature regularization (\u03bb=1e\u22124). This serves as the baseline for subsequent isolated loss experiments.",
